<p>Quickly drain the heat from your target's brain, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">184, 248, 298, 340, 377</acronym> Cold damage.</p><p>Affected creatures will also be brainlocked for 4 turns, putting a random talent on cooldown, and freezing cooldowns.</p><p>The damage and chance to brainlock increase with your Mindpower.</p>